{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json",
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "name": "ctfkit",
          "informationUri": "https://github.com/compliancetf/ctfkit",
          "version": "1.0.0",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "ctf.exec.module_endpoint",
              "name": "exec.module_endpoint",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "A module called from inside another module is installed from a source outside the allowed module endpoints"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A module called from inside another module is installed from a source outside the allowed module endpoints"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "A module called from inside another module is installed from a source outside the allowed module endpoints. When the finding is intended, record an exception with an approver and a review date in the ctfkit exception registry; ctfkit then suppresses it until the review date passes. Documentation: https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#code-that-runs-on-the-machine-that-plans-or-applies",
                "markdown": "**A module called from inside another module is installed from a source outside the allowed module endpoints.**\n\n### When the finding is intended\n\nWhen the finding is intended, record an exception with an approver and a review date in the ctfkit exception registry; ctfkit then suppresses it until the review date passes.\n\n```yaml\nexceptions:\n  - rule: ctf.exec.module_endpoint\n    resource: <address in the finding>\n    justification: <why>\n    approved_by: <approver>\n    review_date: \"YYYY-MM-DD\"\n```\n\n[ctfkit by compliance.tf: rule reference](https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#code-that-runs-on-the-machine-that-plans-or-applies)"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://compliance.tf/docs/ctfkit/analyzers/#code-that-runs-on-the-machine-that-plans-or-applies",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "compliance",
                  "terraform",
                  "exec"
                ],
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "7.5"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "properties": {
        "ctf.catalogVersion": {
          "version": "2026.11.1",
          "origin": "embedded"
        }
      },
      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "ctf.exec.module_endpoint",
          "level": "error",
          "kind": "fail",
          "message": {
            "text": "Module module.s3_bucket_notification.module.metrics is installed from bobthecorp.compliance.tf/terraform-aws-modules/cloudwatch/aws, which is not an allowed module endpoint; its code runs when this configuration is planned and applied"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": ".terraform/modules/s3_bucket_notification/modules/notification/main.tf"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 7,
                  "endLine": 9
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "module.s3_bucket_notification.module.metrics",
                  "kind": "module"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "ctfkitFindingHash/v1": "c46e3dec5ee4dae20f28eb784fc0c9de93e76bac4bb1f1aeaa691cb47e8445e5"
          },
          "properties": {
            "ctf.schema": "1.0",
            "ctf.stage": "post_init",
            "ctf.controlIds": [],
            "ctf.frameworks": [],
            "ctf.preventive": false,
            "ctf.evidence": {
              "runId": "ctfkit-fixture-run",
